flowchart LR
    classDef state fill:#fff5d6,stroke:#a07c10,stroke-width:1px
    classDef agent fill:#d6e6ff,stroke:#103e8a,stroke-width:1px
    classDef tool fill:#dff6e0,stroke:#1c6b2c,stroke-width:1px
    classDef io fill:#f8d4d4,stroke:#8a1010,stroke-width:1px

    BM[(Benchmark<br/>HumanEval / MBPP)]:::io
    STATE{{AgentState<br/>TypedDict compartido}}:::state
    PM[Product Manager<br/>PRD]:::agent
    AR[Arquitecto<br/>DesignDoc]:::agent
    DEV[Developer<br/>CodeArtifact]:::agent
    QA[QA Tester<br/>TestResults]:::tool
    REV[Code Reviewer<br/>ReviewComments]:::agent
    SBX[/Sandbox Python<br/>subproceso, timeout, builtins restringidos/]:::tool
    CSV[(CSV por config<br/>+ telemetría)]:::io

    BM --> STATE
    STATE -->|problem_statement| PM
    PM -->|prd| STATE
    STATE -->|prd, signature| AR
    AR -->|design_doc| STATE
    STATE -->|design_doc, statement| DEV
    DEV -->|code_artifact| STATE
    STATE -->|code, test_cases| QA
    QA -.->|exec| SBX
    SBX -.->|pass/fail| QA
    QA -->|test_results| STATE
    STATE -->|code, tests, design| REV
    REV -->|review_comments| STATE
    REV -. revision_count < max .-> DEV
    STATE -->|telemetría agregada| CSV